+---------------+---------+----------+-----------+---------+---------------------------+
| 1.25B-A125M   |   768   |    12    |    12     |  3072   | 1.25B / 125M (16 experts) |
| 3.6B-A360M    |  1024   |    24    |    16     |  4096   | 3.6B / 360M (16 experts)  |
